(b) The effective dates in paragraph (a) supersede and prevail over the effective date of any other amendments to the sections in paragraph (a) enacted in the 2025 regular or special session of the legislature, regardless of order of enactment. The effective dates for changes made to the sections in paragraph (a) during the 2023-2024 legislative sessions are void.

EFFECTIVE DATE.

This section is effective the day following final enactment.
